# Shopify Print Collection — Tiered Quantity Pricing (Context Handoff)

## Requirement
Ek "Prints" collection ke liye tiered pricing offer chahiye:
- **Base price per print: ₹65,000**
- Offer sirf exact quantities **2, 4, 6** pe apply hoga
- Quantities **1, 3, 5 (aur 7+)** pe koi offer nahi — base price hi lagega
- Offer sirf iss ek collection pe scoped hai, baaki store pe koi effect nahi

### Pricing table (from screenshot)
| Prints | Price/Print | Total Price | Savings |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | ₹65,000 | ₹65,000 | — (no offer) |
| 2 | ₹60,000 | ₹1,20,000 | ₹10,000 |
| 3 | ₹65,000 | ₹1,95,000 | — (no offer, base rate) |
| 4 | ₹55,000 | ₹2,20,000 | ₹40,000 |
| 5 | ₹65,000 | ₹3,25,000 | — (no offer, base rate) |
| 6 | ₹50,000 | ₹3,00,000 | ₹90,000 |

## Approach
Shopify **Discount Function** (JavaScript, target `cart.lines.discounts.generate.run`, API version `2026-01`) — no theme code touched, no product price changed in DB, isolated app extension, fully reversible by deactivating the discount.

Optional cosmetic addition: a Liquid snippet showing a "You Saved ₹X" banner on the cart page/drawer using `cart.cart_level_discount_applications`.

