### Placement steps
1. Shopify Admin → Online Store → Themes → "..." → Edit code.
2. Snippets → Add a new snippet → name: `cart-savings-banner` → paste code above → Save.
3. Open `sections/main-cart-items.liquid` (naam theme ke hisaab se alag ho sakta hai) → cart items table/loop shuru hone se pehle add karo: `{% render 'cart-savings-banner' %}`
4. Open `snippets/cart-drawer.liquid` → drawer ke andar cart items list shuru hone se pehle wahi line add karo.
5. Save, test — 2 ya 4 prints cart mein daalo, banner dikhna chahiye.

**Note**: Exact line placement theme-specific hai (Dawn vs custom theme). Agar apni theme ki `main-cart-items.liquid` / `cart-drawer.liquid` files share karoge, exact jagah bata sakte hain.

